		<member kind="property" name="finished_callable">
			<signature>var finished_callable: Callable = Callable()</signature>
			<description>完成判断回调，签名为 [code]func(task: GFCallableRuntimeTask, scheduler: GFRuntimeTaskScheduler) -&gt; bool[/code]。
