			<signature>var end_callable: Callable = Callable()</signature>
			<description>结束回调，签名为 [code]func(interrupted: bool, task: GFCallableRuntimeTask, scheduler: GFRuntimeTaskScheduler) -&gt; void[/code]。</description>
			<tags>
